1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,302
Booking the Fontainebleau Miami Beach?

2
00:00:02,302 --> 00:00:04,145
Here's what to know before you pay.

3
00:00:04,655 --> 00:00:07,666
A four and a half star resort, right on
Miami Beach.

4
00:00:08,256 --> 00:00:10,369
Guests rate it eight point six out of ten.

5
00:00:11,819 --> 00:00:14,845
It has fifteen hundred and four rooms, and
eleven pools.

6
00:00:16,295 --> 00:00:18,511
It has twelve restaurants, and two bars.

7
00:00:19,961 --> 00:00:21,477
And it sits right on the beach.

8
00:00:24,233 --> 00:00:25,797
First, what's worth your time.

9
00:00:25,797 --> 00:00:28,143
And stay until the end, for the honest
score.

10
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:30,933
The pools come first.

11
00:00:30,933 --> 00:00:34,539
Eleven of them, with cabanas, and a wide
beach just beyond.

12
00:00:35,039 --> 00:00:35,793
Then the room.

13
00:00:35,793 --> 00:00:40,212
Six hundred fifty eight of them come with
a kitchen, which helps on a longer stay.

14
00:00:40,712 --> 00:00:45,512
And the food: twelve restaurants, from
Cantonese to Italian, plus the pool bars.

15
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:47,966
Now, what does it really cost?

16
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:55,085
The resort fee covers wifi, the gym, a daily fitness class,
and a beach chair for each guest.

17
00:00:55,585 --> 00:00:59,961
Not included: beach umbrellas, the spa,
and entry to the LIV night club.

18
00:01:00,461 --> 00:01:06,940
And the extras: the resort fee itself, paid on top of your
room, and the valet, which guests call very expensive.

19
00:01:07,833 --> 00:01:09,419
So, what do guests really say?

20
00:01:10,917 --> 00:01:12,415
Here's what's behind that score.

21
00:01:12,916 --> 00:01:15,192
What guests love: the huge pool area.

22
00:01:15,692 --> 00:01:16,638
The wide beach.

23
00:01:17,138 --> 00:01:18,594
And the energy of the lobby.

24
00:01:19,094 --> 00:01:22,109
What they complain about: club bass on the
lower floors.

25
00:01:22,610 --> 00:01:24,305
Fees on top of the room price.

26
00:01:24,805 --> 00:01:26,220
And a long line at check in.

27
00:01:27,683 --> 00:01:28,849
Now, the don't list.

28
00:01:28,849 --> 00:01:32,638
Don't book a low floor in the Chateau
tower if you sleep lightly.

29
00:01:32,638 --> 00:01:34,911
The club bass reaches the lower floors.

30
00:01:35,411 --> 00:01:36,880
Don't reach the pool late.

31
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:39,818
Guests say the chairs go early, so be
there by nine.

32
00:01:40,318 --> 00:01:44,261
And you can't walk into the LIV night club
just because you sleep here.

33
00:01:44,261 --> 00:01:45,538
Entry is not automatic.

34
00:01:46,433 --> 00:01:47,879
Now, where is it exactly?

35
00:01:49,383 --> 00:01:53,984
The nearest airport is Miami International, about twenty
five minutes by road.

36
00:01:54,483 --> 00:01:57,761
A taxi typically costs thirty five to
forty five dollars.

37
00:01:58,261 --> 00:02:01,632
The airport bus costs just two dollars and
twenty five cents.

38
00:02:02,131 --> 00:02:04,927
Around the hotel, the beach is a one
minute walk.

39
00:02:05,426 --> 00:02:07,840
Indian Beach Park is five minutes on foot.

40
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:11,135
And the Miami Beach Boardwalk is three
minutes by car.

41
00:02:12,633 --> 00:02:13,607
When should you go?

42
00:02:15,117 --> 00:02:17,449
The best weather runs from December to
April.

43
00:02:17,950 --> 00:02:21,324
That's also when prices peak, with the
biggest crowds in March.

44
00:02:21,825 --> 00:02:25,595
From June to October, it's hot, rainy, and
hurricane season.

45
00:02:26,096 --> 00:02:30,287
The sweet spot is May and November: fewer
crowds, and lower prices.

46
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:33,016
And now, the verdict.

47
00:02:34,483 --> 00:02:36,903
It's great for party lovers and pool
people.

48
00:02:37,403 --> 00:02:41,142
It's not for light sleepers, or for anyone
who hates extra fees.

49
00:02:41,642 --> 00:02:43,548
The honest score: eight out of ten.

50
00:02:47,333 --> 00:02:48,808
That was the Fontainebleau.

51
00:02:48,808 --> 00:02:50,830
Which hotel should we check out next?

52
00:02:50,830 --> 00:02:52,141
Tell me in the comments.
